flowchart TB
  UI[Shell + existing material workflows + academic views]
  QUERIES[Domain query modules: materials / assignments / grades / attendance]
  TAURI[Tauri command and event adapter]
  SCAN[Scan coordinator: shared request budget and per-domain coverage]
  GATE[Verified student identity + source capability + route/policy checks]
  subgraph COLLECT[Concrete collection modules; introduced as each feature ships]
    MATERIALS[Existing materials and announcements]
    ASSIGN[Assignments: effective dates + submission observations]
    GRADES[Grades: student-visible items + reported totals]
    ATT[Attendance: supported own report only; conditional]
  end
  HTTP[Authenticated request adapter]
  QUANTA[Quanta Moodle]
  subgraph RECON[Domain reconciliation modules]
    R1[Resource reconciliation]
    R2[Assignment reconciliation + deadline projection]
    R3[Grade reconciliation]
    R4[Attendance reconciliation]
  end
  STORE[SQLite: student-owned records, source facts, freshness,
  per-domain successful baselines and migration ledger]
  CHANGES[Committed domain changes]
  POLICY[Notification content/transport policy]
  MIRROR[Material-eligible mirror only]
  UI --> QUERIES --> TAURI
  TAURI --> SCAN --> GATE --> COLLECT
  COLLECT --> HTTP <--> QUANTA
  MATERIALS --> R1
  ASSIGN --> R2
  GRADES --> R3
  ATT --> R4
  RECON --> STORE
  STORE --> QUERIES
  STORE --> CHANGES --> POLICY
  CHANGES --> MIRROR
  NOTE[Phase B: new behavior, gated by live source evidence.
  No universal resource record, runtime plugin registry, or new server.]
